---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="FAQ - Staff Portal">
  <main class="min-h-screen bg-gray-50">
    <div class="bg-primary-600 text-white">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mb-4">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-primary-100">Find answers to common questions about managing Dzaleka Online Services</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-8">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <!-- Content Management -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm p-6 mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-6">Content Management</h2>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-2">How do I publish news articles?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">Use Blogger.com to create and publish news articles. Make sure to follow our content guidelines, include proper metadata, and respect cultural sensitivities. All articles should be reviewed before publishing.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-2">What are the image requirements for the archive?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">Images should be in JPG or PNG format, optimized for web (compressed), and have a minimum resolution of 1200x800 pixels. Always include descriptive alt text and proper attribution for cultural content.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-2">How do I add new services to the directory?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">Use the staff portal to add new services. Include complete information about the service, contact details, operating hours, and any relevant documentation. All services must be verified before being published.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Community Engagement -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm p-6 mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-6">Community Engagement</h2>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-2">How do I submit community events?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">Events can be submitted through the staff portal. Include event details, date, location, and any special requirements. Cultural events should be properly categorized and include relevant cultural context.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-2">What are the guidelines for cultural content?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">All cultural content must be respectful and accurate. Include proper context, translations when needed, and respect cultural sensitivities. Consult with community representatives when in doubt.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-2">How do I handle multilingual content?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">Content should be provided in English and relevant community languages when possible. Use the translation tools provided in the portal and ensure accuracy of translations.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Resource Management -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm p-6 mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-6">Resource Management</h2>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-2">How do I add resources to the archive?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">Use the resource upload form in the staff portal. Include proper categorization, metadata, and ensure the resource is properly formatted and accessible. All resources must be reviewed before being published.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-2">What types of resources can be archived?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">We archive cultural artifacts, historical documents, educational materials, community resources, and digital content. All resources must be relevant to the Dzaleka community and follow our archiving guidelines.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-2">How do I manage resource permissions?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">Use the permission settings in the staff portal to control access to sensitive resources. Some resources may require special access or community approval before being made public.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Technical Support -->
        <section class="bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm p-6">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-6">Technical Support</h2>
          <div class="space-y-6">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-2">How do I report technical issues?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">Use the help desk portal to submit a support ticket. Include details about the issue, screenshots if applicable, and your contact information. Our technical team will respond within 24 hours.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-2">What are the system requirements?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">The staff portal works best on modern browsers (Chrome, Firefox, Safari). Ensure you have a stable internet connection and sufficient storage space for uploading content.</p>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-2">How do I backup my content?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">Regular backups are automatically performed. For manual backups, use the export function in the staff portal. Always keep local copies of important content.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <!-- Contact Support -->
        <div class="mt-8 text-center">
          <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">Need additional help?</p>
          <a href="/staff/help-desk" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 border border-transparent text-base font-medium rounded-md text-white bg-primary-600 hover:bg-primary-700">
            Contact Support
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</MainLayout>

<style>
  .prose h3 {
    @apply text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-2;
  }
  .prose p {
    @apply text-gray-600;
  }
</style> 